        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Fulgencio Batista y Zaldívar, Osvaldo Farrés, Miguel Matamoros, Carlos Puebla\n- Songs: \"Quizás, Quizás, Quizás\"\n- Events: Cuban coup d'état of 1952\n\nFacts:\n- Fulgencio Batista y Zaldívar overthrew the Cuban government in the 1952 Cuban coup d'état.\n- Osvaldo Farrés composed the song \"Quizás, Quizás, Quizás.\"\n- Miguel Matamoros served as an inspiration for Osvaldo Farrés.\n- Carlos Puebla was overthrown by Fulgencio Batista y Zaldívar.",
